	(text "Feedback Breakout Rev C - 16 channels, THT, rail-generic\nNode: 100k pull-down + 10nF filter. Indicator: 100k base -> BC337 common emitter -> RE -> LED,\nso the LED draws its current from the rail and only ~40uA from the sense node.\nRE = 1k for 5V, 470R for 3V3. All other values identical on both rails."
